        "action": "Create a National Equal\u2011Standards Framework for Public\u2011Space Management",
        "additional_details": "Public spaces support charities, faith groups, campaigners, artists and volunteers. But rules vary widely between local authorities, and similar activities can be treated differently. A national equal\u2011standards framework would ensure clear, consistent, behaviour\u2011based rules so public spaces are managed fairly across the country.",
        "background": "Create a clear, nationally consistent equal\u2011standards framework for public\u2011space management so all groups and activities are treated fairly and rules are applied consistently across the country.",
